>...What does that actually do?
>I tried some sourcediving, but couldnt find out for sure if the Displacement
>actually does anything other than say, a similar enchanted normal cloak...

It makes you appear (from the monsters' point of view) up to two squares
away from where you actually are.  This can lead to the monsters hitting
each other, on occasion :)

If you are invisible, displacement only confuses monsters who can see
invisible; monsters who cannot see invisible will suffer only the lesser
positional confusion afforded by invisibility.
